	quest_links: [ ]
	quests: [
		{
			description: [
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>Terramity 将我的世界带到了下界合金之后。新增宝石、金属、五个首领、一堆枪械，以及你永远无法一次性穿戴完的配饰。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>这整个东西就是一个梯子。每种金属都踩在梯横上，不能跳过任何一个。同一梯横上的两种金属是平等的，所以选哪个都随你喜欢。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>右侧固定的等级图表是模组自带的。越高越好，同一高度代表同一等级。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[间隔=5]"
				"---"
				"[间隔=5]"
				""
				"## <grad from=#8FCB3F to=#DDF5A8 f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>万物生长的地方</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>本章包含金属和首领。其余部分已拆分，以保持可读性：</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"{ \"text\": \"Structures\", \"underlined\": \"true\", \"color\": \"#B98A5E\", \"clickEvent\": { \"action\": \"change_page\", \"value\": \"55CF3612F2588EA7\" } }"
				"{ \"text\": \"Arsenal\", \"underlined\": \"true\", \"color\": \"#C89A5A\", \"clickEvent\": { \"action\": \"change_page\", \"value\": \"7B2049B841F6A946\" } }"
				"{ \"text\": \"Accessories\", \"underlined\": \"true\", \"color\": \"#E29AD2\", \"clickEvent\": { \"action\": \"change_page\", \"value\": \"44F86CB070F12FF2\" } }"
				"{ \"text\": \"Brutality\", \"underlined\": \"true\", \"color\": \"#C0392B\", \"clickEvent\": { \"action\": \"change_page\", \"value\": \"3AE3B2BE4A65CEF6\" } }"
				"{ \"text\": \"Lethality\", \"underlined\": \"true\", \"color\": \"#A31419\", \"clickEvent\": { \"action\": \"change_page\", \"value\": \"20FAEEFB40B0A5B7\" } }"
				"{ \"text\": \"Summonity\", \"underlined\": \"true\", \"color\": \"#6EC5E8\", \"clickEvent\": { \"action\": \"change_page\", \"value\": \"1972E6247504B332\" } }"
				""
			]
			icon: {
				Count: 1
				ForgeCaps: {
					Parent: {
						Items: [ ]
						Size: 0
					}
				}
				id: "terramity:blood_contract"
