		{
			dependencies: ["16127A006FEEAF69"]
			description: [
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>每套完整的宝石盔甲都有其独特的能力：</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#C8AE86 to=#EBD9B8 f=0.8>Ruby</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 提供10秒的火焰抗性，冷却时间为120秒。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#C8AE86 to=#EBD9B8 f=0.8>Sapphire</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 提供30秒的水肺效果，冷却时间为120秒。</grad></shadow>"
				"[gap=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#C8AE86 to=#EBD9B8 f=0.8>Topaz</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 提供8秒缓慢下落效果，冷却时间为30秒。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#C8AE86 to=#EBD9B8 f=0.8>Onyx</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 会像紫颂果一样将你随机传送到某个地方，冷却时间为30秒。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>奥尼克斯很有趣。奥尼克斯也是你掉进峡谷的方式。</grad></shadow>"
			]
