		{
			dependencies: ["16127A006FEEAF69"]
			description: [
				"# <grad from=#E24B4B to=#FFB4B4 f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>哥布，侏儒之王</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>一个雄心勃勃的小侏儒，从不因身高而退缩。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>借助一些非常不自然的物质，戈布变得比其他所有侏儒都高大强壮，并以房间里最吵闹的生物身份夺得了王冠。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"{image:customtextures:textures/gob_image.png width:100 height:86 align:center}"
				""
				"[间隔=5]"
				"---"
				"[间隔=5]"
				""
				"## <grad from=#E24B4B to=#FFB4B4 f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>召唤他</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>找到一个只在黑暗森林和沼泽中生成的</grad><grad from=#E24B4B to=#FFB4B4 f=0.8>侏儒庭院</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。里面有一个金侏儒雕像。用</grad><grad from=#E24B4B to=#FFB4B4 f=0.8>红色侏儒帽</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>右键雕像即可。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"{image:customtextures:textures/courtgnome.png width:250 height:100 align:center}"
				"{image:customtextures:textures/courtgnome2.png width:250 height:100 align:center}"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>它有 </grad><grad from=#E24B4B to=#FFB4B4 f=0.8>1350 生命值</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。带上钻石或下界合金盔甲，以及高伤害武器。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>他掉落了 </grad><grad from=#E24B4B to=#FFB4B4 f=0.8>Dimlite</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 和 </grad><grad from=#E24B4B to=#FFB4B4 f=0.8>Virentium</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 的锻造模板，这正是你此行的目的所在。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"{ \"text\": \"Court of Gnomes locator\", \"underlined\": \"true\", \"color\": \"#B98A5E\", \"clickEvent\": { \"action\": \"change_page\", \"value\": \"55CF3612F2588EA7\" } }"
			]
			icon: {
				Count: 1
