		}
		{
			dependencies: ["16127A006FEEAF69"]
			description: [
				"# <grad from=#E24B4B to=#FFB4B4 f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>超级嗅探者</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>你一直觉得嗅探者既</grad><grad from=#E24B4B to=#FFB4B4 f=0.8>弱小</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>又</grad><grad from=#E24B4B to=#FFB4B4 f=0.8>没用</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。嗅探者自己也清楚这一点。它们只是懒得去改变现状罢了。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>用一点激励的电流就能解决这个问题了。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"{image:customtextures:textures/super_sniffer_image.png width:100 height:75 align:center}"
				""
				"[gap=5]"
				"---"
				"[gap=5]"
				""
				"## <grad from=#E24B4B to=#FFB4B4 f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>召唤他</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>用闪电击中普通嗅探者。制作一个 </grad><grad from=#E24B4B to=#FFB4B4 f=0.8>闪电法杖</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>，然后对准嗅探者旁边的位置，而不是直接对准它，否则你只是在烤制它而已。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>他拥有 </grad><grad from=#E24B4B to=#FFB4B4 f=0.8>1500 生命值</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>，并且可以远程攻击。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!warning] 先建造竞技场。用黑曜石屏障挡住他的光束攻击。他的精神炸弹会穿过你建造的任何东西，所以保持移动。"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>他掉落了 </grad><grad from=#E24B4B to=#FFB4B4 f=0.8>Cosmilite</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 和 </grad><grad from=#E24B4B to=#FFB4B4 f=0.8>Virentium</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 锻造模板。</grad></shadow>"
			]
