		{
			dependencies: ["5BF85D0A3254B959"]
			description: [
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>Dimlite 矿石均匀分布在主世界的 </grad><grad from=#2FB8B0 to=#A8F0EA f=0.8>Y -44</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 和 </grad><grad from=#2FB8B0 to=#A8F0EA f=0.8>Y -64</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 之间。开采未挖掘的 dimlite，然后将其与 </grad><grad from=#2FB8B0 to=#A8F0EA f=0.8>echo shards</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 结合。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>锻造模板由 </grad><grad from=#2FB8B0 to=#A8F0EA f=0.8>Gob</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>掉落，可升级下界合金装备。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"## <grad from=#2FB8B0 to=#A8F0EA f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>套装加成</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>一套完整的 Dimlite 装备会发出音爆，造成光伤害并将你向后推，冷却时间为 </grad><grad from=#2FB8B0 to=#A8F0EA f=0.8>8 秒</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。这是模组中冷却时间最短的一套，也是非常好用的逃生手段。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>它的镐是四种可以挖掘铱、恶魔矿石、熔渣和腐化黑物质的镐之一。</grad></shadow>"
			]
