		{
			dependencies: [
				"5BF85D0A3254B959"
				"157C39FF1051EA3E"
			]
			description: [
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>Gaianite ore 在茂密洞穴中以三角形模式生成，位于 </grad><grad from=#4FC26A to=#B8F0C6 f=0.8>Y 20</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 和 </grad><grad from=#4FC26A to=#B8F0C6 f=0.8>Y -64</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 之间。如果你更喜欢刷矿而不是挖矿，Gaia lilies 也会掉落它。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>将盖亚石与</grad><grad from=#4FC26A to=#B8F0C6 f=0.8>下界合金废料</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>结合以制作锭。</grad></shadow>"
