				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>星尘残骸均匀地分布在末地的 </grad><grad from=#5B6BD8 to=#BEC6F5 f=0.8>Y 50</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 和 </grad><grad from=#5B6BD8 to=#BEC6F5 f=0.8>Y 0</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 之间。将它们打碎获得宇宙废料，再将废料与 </grad><grad from=#5B6BD8 to=#BEC6F5 f=0.8>金锭</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 结合。</grad></shadow>"
