		{
			dependencies: ["516A877FEC4701DD"]
			description: [
				"# <grad from=#E24B4B to=#FFB4B4 f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>试炼守护者</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>一位富有的国王曾在他巨大的密室中举行残酷的试炼，而他的守护者对任何闯入者都毫不留情，声名远扬。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>时间终究带走了国王。守护者仍孤身一人待在下面，等待着最后一位参赛者。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"{image:customtextures:textures/trial_guardian_image.png width:100 height:65 align:center}"
				""
				"[间隔=5]"
				"---"
				"[gap=5]"
				""
				"## <grad from=#E24B4B to=#FFB4B4 f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>召唤它</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#E24B4B to=#FFB4B4 f=0.8>Trial Spires</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 在任何海洋中生成。一路向下走到地下室，找到锁，并插入一把 </grad><grad from=#E24B4B to=#FFB4B4 f=0.8>Spire Key</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。钥匙散落在尖塔各处。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!danger] 免疫所有投射物伤害。你拥有的所有枪在这场战斗中都只是装饰品。带上近战武器。"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#E24B4B to=#FFB4B4 f=0.8>3000 生命值</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。尖塔是一个很长的地牢，所以请做好准备再进去。"
				""
				"它会掉落Perish Staff，这是Terramity中最重要的物品，还有Hellspec、Void和Conductite的锻造模板。"
				""
				"{image:customtextures:textures/trialspire.png width:250 height:100 align:center}"
				""
				"{ \"text\": \"Trial Spire locator\", \"underlined\": \"true\", \"color\": \"#B98A5E\", \"clickEvent\": { \"action\": \"change_page\", \"value\": \"55CF3612F2588EA7\" } }"
			]
			icon: {
				Count: 1
				id: "ftbquests:custom_icon"
				tag: {
					Icon: "brutality:item/curio/head/trial_guardian_hands/trial_guardian_hands_inventory"
				}
			}
