				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>这就是获取 </grad><grad from=#7B4BE2 to=#C9B0FF f=0.8>Black Matter</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 和 </grad><grad from=#7B4BE2 to=#C9B0FF f=0.8>Decayed Bedrock Dust</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 的方法，缺少其中任何一种，模组就会在此停止运行。</grad></shadow>"
