				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>铱、暗物质和地底水晶。模板来自 </grad><grad from=#E2683B to=#FFC0A8 f=0.8>试炼守护者</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>，应用于铱制装备。</grad></shadow>"
