				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>生命偷取，持续 </grad><grad from=#E2683B to=#FFC0A8 f=0.8>25秒</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>，冷却时间为 </grad><grad from=#E2683B to=#FFC0A8 f=0.8>60秒</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。每次攻击会恢复部分伤害，每击最多恢复半颗心。</grad></shadow>"
