			y: 7.8d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["2C6FC2D93C93E3DC"]
			description: [
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>铱、暗物质和</grad><grad from=#3BD8E2 to=#A8F2FF f=0.8>电路板</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。模板来自</grad><grad from=#3BD8E2 to=#A8F2FF f=0.8>试炼守卫者</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"## <grad from=#3BD8E2 to=#A8F2FF f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>套装加成</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>工厂重置。清除你所有的状态效果，无论好坏，冷却时间为 </grad><grad from=#3BD8E2 to=#A8F2FF f=0.8>180秒</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。三者中冷却时间最长，也是应对大量负面效果的唯一有效方法。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>它的镐可以挖掘 </grad><grad from=#3BD8E2 to=#A8F2FF f=0.8>Profaned Ore</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>，而这种金属正是制造 </grad><grad from=#3BD8E2 to=#A8F2FF f=0.8>Railgun</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 和 </grad><grad from=#3BD8E2 to=#A8F2FF f=0.8>Conductite Laser Rifle</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 的材料。</grad></shadow>"
			]
