		{
			dependencies: [
				"3284A47CBF5B8EE9"
				"1E35A72FD965B419"
				"1B0DEADF966579CF"
			]
			description: [
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>被污染的矿石位于主世界的深处，介于 </grad><grad from=#FF8A2B to=#FFD2A0 f=0.8>Y -10</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 和 </grad><grad from=#FF8A2B to=#FFD2A0 f=0.8>Y -64</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 之间，只有地狱锭、虚空锭或导电锭镐才能开采它。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!danger] 未加工的 Profanum 灼热无比，仅仅是携带就会让你燃起火焰。将其冶炼也绝非易事。请先准备好火焰抗性或 {Flameguard Pendant}。"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>Profanum 是所有三种最终金属的基础，有了它你才能建造 Moondrill 大炮并正确击穿基岩。</grad></shadow>"
			]
			icon: "terramity:profanum"
			id: "5D9252B669B888FE"
			rewards: [
				{
					id: "197A7421862158D9"
					item: "terramity:profanum"
