		{
			dependencies: ["5D9252B669B888FE"]
			description: [
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>你并非在钻月亮，而是在射向月亮并接住碎片。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"## <grad from=#9B6BFF to=#DCC9FF f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>使用它</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"1. <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>将一块</grad><grad from=#9B6BFF to=#DCC9FF f=0.8>电池</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>放在大炮下方。电池会被吃掉，大炮就会充能。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"2. <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>等待大炮变成黄色发光状态。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"3. <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>在月亮正上方的时候，向 </grad><grad from=#9B6BFF to=#DCC9FF f=0.8>午夜</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>开火。其他时间则无事发生。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>月光石原矿从天而降。它会变成 </grad><grad from=#9B6BFF to=#DCC9FF f=0.8>乳白月光石</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>，而乳白月光石则会变成尼克斯石。</grad></shadow>"
			]
			icon: "terramity:moondrill_cannon"
			id: "4824216451CB93E3"
			rewards: [
				{
					id: "292B985497C34338"
					item: "terramity:circuit_board"
					random_bonus: 3
					type: "item"
				}
				{
					exclude_from_claim_all: true
