		{
			dependencies: ["06406B2D8A9A618D"]
			description: [
				"# <grad from=#E24B4B to=#FFB4B4 f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>美德</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>一个符合圣经描述的天使，显然对你把不洁的长矛投向它的天空感到很不高兴。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"{image:customtextures:textures/virtue_image.png width:100 height:75 align:center}"
				""
				"[gap=5]"
				"---"
				"[间隔=5]"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#E24B4B to=#FFB4B4 f=0.8>4000 生命值</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>，模组里第二难对付的东西。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"它会掉落用于制作Reverium的<c1>Angel Feathers</c1>，同时也是获取<c2>Music Sheet of Cleansing</c2>的常见来源之一。"
			]
			icon: "terramity:archangel_halo"
