		{
			description: [
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>冥界地牢位于下界，通常被熔岩湖淹没。居住其中的生物会掉落神秘织物。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>那块织物是通往最后一个真正首领的唯一钥匙。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"{ \"text\": \"Chthonic Dungeon locator\", \"underlined\": \"true\", \"color\": \"#B98A5E\", \"clickEvent\": { \"action\": \"change_page\", \"value\": \"55CF3612F2588EA7\" } }"
			]
