		{
			dependencies: [
				"65C1AD0572949E56"
				"19CBC92610B35600"
			]
			description: [
				"# <grad from=#E24B4B to=#FFB4B4 f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>西尔西与梅林</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>两个自以为下界属于他们的熊孩子。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>他们的自尊心高得离谱，一开始会直接无视你，因为他们觉得你没资格让他们费工夫。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>梅林有 </grad><grad from=#E24B4B to=#FFB4B4 f=0.8>600点生命值</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>，而西尔西则有 </grad><grad from=#E24B4B to=#FFB4B4 f=0.8>900点</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。他们都会召唤帮手，所以战斗远比这些数字看起来要激烈得多。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[gap=5]"
				"---"
				"[间隔=5]"
				""
				"## <grad from=#E24B4B to=#FFB4B4 f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>将它们召唤出来</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>在末地屋顶上找到 </grad><grad from=#E24B4B to=#FFB4B4 f=0.8>Chthonic Cathedral</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。里面有一个祭坛。用 </grad><grad from=#E24B4B to=#FFB4B4 f=0.8>Occult Fabric</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 右键点击它。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!warning] 把它们留在竞技场里。如果走得太远，它们会以奇怪的方式损坏。"
				""
				"{image:customtextures:textures/cathedral.png width:250 height:100 align:center}"
				""
				"{ \"text\": \"Chthonic Cathedral locator\", \"underlined\": \"true\", \"color\": \"#B98A5E\", \"clickEvent\": { \"action\": \"change_page\", \"value\": \"55CF3612F2588EA7\" } }"
			]
			icon: {
