		{
			dependencies: [
				"4095D45E6F47975A"
				"7B8D5CEBA193AC34"
				"004807CDCE0EEB28"
			]
			description: [
				"# <grad from=#E24B4B to=#FFB4B4 f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>超嗅探者</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>泰拉米蒂里最难的东西，它不在任何进度阶段里。它在之后。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#E24B4B to=#FFB4B4 f=0.8>9001 生命值</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>. 是的，真的。 </grad></shadow>"
				""
				"{image:customtextures:textures/ultra_sniffer_image.png width:100 height:100 align:center}"
				""
				"[gap=5]"
				"---"
				"[间隔=5]"
				""
				"## <grad from=#E24B4B to=#FFB4B4 f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>召唤他</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>让</grad><grad from=#E24B4B to=#FFB4B4 f=0.8>超级嗅探者</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>进入其</grad><grad from=#E24B4B to=#FFB4B4 f=0.8>第二阶段</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>，并将生命降至</grad><grad from=#E24B4B to=#FFB4B4 f=0.8>10%</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>，然后用闪电再次击中它。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>在他濒死但仍向你射击时完成这些，才是挑战的关键所在。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"## <grad from=#E24B4B to=#FFB4B4 f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>尝试之前</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>用黑曜石或其他同样难搞的材料建造一个平坦、坚固的竞技场。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>用来抵挡他激光的柱子和障碍物。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>末地盔甲、高机动性配件，以及一把你信赖的武器。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!danger] 他几乎无法被杀死，强烈不建议尝试。如果你非要这么做，他会掉落游戏中最好的装备之一。"
			]
