		{
			dependencies: ["05D0AF91008E3155"]
			description: [
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>受到任何伤害时，你会被动获得 </grad><grad from=#E24B4B to=#FFB4B4 f=0.8>超临界打击</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。超临界打击造成的伤害为 </grad><grad from=#E24B4B to=#FFB4B4 f=0.8>2倍基础伤害</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>，基础概率为 </grad><grad from=#E24B4B to=#FFB4B4 f=0.8>25%</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>，并且与模组中其他所有暴击不同，它完全不受幸运值的影响。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>将暴击几率提升至</grad><grad from=#E24B4B to=#FFB4B4 f=0.8>100%</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>，持续</grad><grad from=#E24B4B to=#FFB4B4 f=0.8>10秒</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>，冷却时间为</grad><grad from=#E24B4B to=#FFB4B4 f=0.8>45秒</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。</grad></shadow>"
